# vscode-html-language-server, vscode-css-language-server, vscode-json-language-server and
# vscode-eslint-language-server (the services extracted from VS Code and vscode-eslint's server). The formatters:
# prettier, and @biomejs/biome (used only when the project names Biome). TypeScript 6.0.3 is the fallback tsserver
# when the project has no node_modules/typescript (TypeScript 7 has no tsserver for typescript-language-server).
